  "evidence": "TEXT_C: “20,000 more police… tougher prisons and segregation of extremists”; “Balanced net migration to zero… one law for all… disband sharia councils; ban face coverings”; “A National, not international, Health Service… +£11bn for the NHS and social care”; “British jobs first… allow preference for under‑25 UK applicants”; “Abolish the House of Lords… halve the Commons… binding citizens’ referenda.”\nTEXT_E: “strong and stable leadership… smooth, orderly Brexit”; “Preserve the Union… increase devolved powers”; “stronger policing, counter‑terror and cyber; retain Trident”; “Confront burning injustices… narrow gender and race pay gaps”; “Great Meritocracy where hard work and talent determine success… worker rights… National Living Wage”; “NHS: at least £8bn… 10,000 more mental health professionals”; “Controlled, sustainable migration: net migration down to the tens of thousands.”",
